# `git.overview`

One-call shape for the git view's default route.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.git.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `workspace_id` | `string` |
| `limit` | `number` |

## Returns

`GitOverviewResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `workspace_id` | `string` |
| `branch` | `string` |
| `head_short` | `string` |
| `clean` | `bool` |
| `total_changed` | `number` |
| `staged` | `map` |
| `modified` | `map` |
| `untracked` | `map` |
| `commits` | `map` |
| `branches` | `map` |
| `ahead` | `number` |
| `behind` | `number` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call git.overview --json '{ "workspace_id": "", "limit": 0 }'
```

Kind: read.

